<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Multi-Language SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; color: white; background-color: black; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
.KRCC { Name: Korean; lang: ko-KR; SAMIType: CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Welcome to our tutorial</P>
<P Class=KRCC>우리의 튜토리얼에 오신 것을 환영합니다</P>

<SYNC Start=3000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Today we will learn about SAMI format</P>
<P Class=KRCC>오늘은 SAMI 형식에 대해 배우겠습니다</P>

<SYNC Start=6000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>SAMI supports multiple languages in one file</P>
<P Class=KRCC>SAMI는 하나의 파일에서 여러 언어를 지원합니다</P>

<SYNC Start=9000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Each language has its own class</P>
<P Class=KRCC>각 언어는 자체 클래스가 있습니다</P>

<SYNC Start=12000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Thank you for watching!</P>
<P Class=KRCC>시청해주셔서 감사합니다!</P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
